
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="description" content="PT Ekspor Yuk - Connecting Indonesian products with global markets.">
  <title>PT Ekspor Yuk | Connecting Indonesia to the World</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #081426;
      color: #fff;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    header {
      padding: 22px 8%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #24344b;
    }
    .logo { font-size: 23px; font-weight: 800; color: #e5bc70; }
    nav a {
      color: #fff; text-decoration: none; margin-left: 24px;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    nav a:hover { color: #e5bc70; }
    .hero {
      min-height: 76vh;
      display: flex; flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 90px 8%;
      background: linear-gradient(110deg, #081426 55%, #142b43);
    }
    .tag {
      color: #e5bc70; text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 3px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold;
    }
    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(40px, 6vw, 76px);
      line-height: 1.08; max-width: 850px;
      margin: 24px 0;
    }
    h1 span { color: #e5bc70; }
    .hero p { max-width: 600px; color: #c2ccda; font-size: 17px; }
    .btn {
      display: inline-block; margin-top: 30px; padding: 14px 24px;
      background: #e5bc70; color: #081426;
      text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; border-radius: 4px;
      width: fit-content;
    }
    section { padding: 75px 8%; }
    section h2 { font-size: 32px; margin-bottom: 18px; }
    section p { color: #c2ccda; max-width: 750px; }
    .cards {
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 20px; margin-top: 30px;
    }
    .card {
      border: 1px solid #2b3c53; padding: 25px;
      border-radius: 8px; background: #101f33;
    }
    .card h3 { color: #e5bc70; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .contact { background: #101f33; }
    footer {
      padding: 25px 8%; border-top: 1px solid #24344b;
      color: #aab6c6; font-size: 13px;
    }
    @media (max-width: 700px) {
      header { flex-direction: column; gap: 15px; }
      nav a { margin: 0 7px; font-size: 12px; }
      .cards { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .hero { min-height: 65vh; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="logo">EKSPOR YUK.</div>
    <nav>
      <a href="#about">About</a>
      <a href="#services">Services</a>
      <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="tag">Indonesian Export Partner</div>
      <h1>Connecting Indonesia<br>to the <span>World.</span></h1>
      <p>
        Discover Indonesian products and explore global trade opportunities
        with PT Ekspor Yuk. Building connections between local potential
        and international markets.
      </p>
      <a class="btn" href="#services">Explore Our Services →</a>
    </section>

    <section id="about">
      <div class="tag">Who We Are</div>
      <h2>Your Gateway to Indonesian Products</h2>
      <p>
        PT Ekspor Yuk aims to connect Indonesian products with international
        market opportunities. We believe that local products can reach a
        wider audience through strong partnerships and professional service.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section id="services">
      <div class="tag">What We Do</div>
      <h2>Our Services</h2>
      <div class="cards">
        <article class="card">
          <h3>Product Sourcing</h3>
          <p>Explore potential Indonesian products and supplier partnerships.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <h3>Export Solutions</h3>
          <p>Discuss export requirements and potential international trade arrangements.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <h3>Global Partnerships</h3>
          <p>Build connections between Indonesian suppliers and international buyers.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="contact" id="contact">
      <div class="tag">Let's Connect</div>
      <h2>Start a Conversation</h2>
      <p>
        Interested in Indonesian products or potential business partnerships?
        Contact our team to discuss your requirements.
      </p>
      <a class="btn" href="mailto:YOUR_EMAIL@example.com">Email Our Team →</a>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    © <span id="year"></span> PT Ekspor Yuk. All rights reserved.
  </footer>
  <script>
    document.getElementById("year").textContent = new Date().getFullYear();
  </script>
</body>
</html>



